SUMMARY:Introduction to Fractal Burning: Tree of Life at Coastal Makers
DESCRIPTION:Coastal Makers teaches the basics of fractal burning in a two 
 hour class where each person makes an 8 by 10 inch Tree of Life piece of 
 wood art. The burn leaves naturally unpredictable Lichtenberg patterns\, 
 so every piece comes out different. No experience is needed\, all supplie
 s are included and the class is limited to six participants.\nPrice: from
